WEBVTT

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.480
Let me go!

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.270
Or I'll take you with me!

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:12.030
Don't worry! I'll save you!

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.660
Takuya, I'm glad we met.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:17.670
Thank you.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.580
For being with me on my last night.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.960
Amanda!

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.130
Nine hundred seconds
to complete synchronization.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.410
Fifteen minutes left...

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:39.890
Now, how many will die?

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:17.030
"Episode 26: A Girl Who Chants Love
at the Bound of This World"

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:19.990
Open the gate!

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:20.860
Evacuate the citizens!

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:22.200
We'll hold the line here!

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:22.910
Hurry!

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:23.740
Go! Go!

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.840
Damn it! We don't even have time to mourn?

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.880
Amanda's still alive!

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:40.380
We'll just have to believe that...

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:41.800
Yeah.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.310
We'll make the ritual a success,
for Amanda's sake!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:55.530
Takuya-<i>kun</i>, would you be willing
to destroy that device for me?

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.480
Ryuzoji...

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:58.490
Don't do it!

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.530
If the barrier breaks, he'll escape!

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.860
The barrier matters! Not me!

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.160
Ayumi-<i>san</i>!

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:20.430
...luk...

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.020
Eihriuluk...

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:32.190
You're always such a sleepyhead.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:33.730
Abel!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.150
Why?

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.480
I followed the disrupted event elements

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.400
and ended up here by chance.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:44.110
So essentially, this is your favorite word.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:45.780
"Fate."

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:49.410
Now let's go.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.600
You're the only one who can stop him.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:57.500
Eight hundred seconds
to complete synchronization.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.380
We're running out of time. Make your choice.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.630
No, Takuya-<i>kun</i>!

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.050
Ayumi-<i>san</i>...

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:06.580
I'm sorry!

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:09.760
That's the right choice!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.270
Ryuzoji, if I let you go,
the event collision will kill everyone!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:17.220
Even if I save Ayumi-<i>san</i>, 
it's the same thing!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.030
No, it's not the same.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.780
Spending the last moments
of your lives together,

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:26.280
sure of each other's love and
holding each other in your arms,

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:30.170
is very different than being murdered here...

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:34.040
It doesn't matter what you say.
My answer doesn't change.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.620
Oh, yes?

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:39.960
But her advisor seems to disagree.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.090
Niarb!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.300
Don't let the Empress die!

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.050
Asche-<i>san</i>!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.300
I'll destroy it!

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:05.650
The Arima family has
caused me no end of troubles,

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.410
but this time, you have my thanks.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.210
It's been fun.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:12.620
Ayumi-<i>san</i>!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.920
Seven hundred seconds until the
dimensional synchronization system

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.620
completes synchronization.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.470
The ritual will end soon,

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.970
in a way you're sure to find thrilling.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.730
This body is no longer needed.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:41.940
So this is...

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:45.030
Ryuzoji's true form?!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.000
Daddy and his friends are...

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.710
Priestess, you must concentrate.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.420
We must advance the synchronization.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:08.930
But if Mother is destroyed, we will die.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:12.620
Many have sacrificed much
for the ritual to be completed.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.870
They all have their roles to play.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:18.280
Their roles...

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:22.860
Priestess, you must fulfill your role too.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.740
Kartz! Deo!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:35.920
Shit!

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.330
Class A dimensional criminal!

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.000
This is the end for you!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.090
You're still alive, huh?

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:49.930
But that gun poses a threat.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.300
You won't escape!

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.900
Abel! You?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.860
Eriko-<i>sensei</i>! You're late!

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.610
I was on a date.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.560
Use my shoulder.

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:21.870
Thank you.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:24.130
Eihriuluk! Now!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.920
Abel, get away!

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.170
Shoot while I've got him!

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:30.420
Hurry! Or he'll escape again!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.930
No! I can't!

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:38.180
I was happy with you.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:42.000
I was unable to reach the event root, but...

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:46.950
In exchange, I learned about eternal love!

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:49.400
Eihriuluk!

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.820
Abel!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:18.180
Ayumi-<i>san</i>, no...

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:21.930
I was able to save you! So many times!

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:30.150
Takuya-<i>kun</i>, this is my fate.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:33.610
I refuse to let my life be ruled
by such a ridiculous thing!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:39.410
No. This was the only reason I was born.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:43.040
Nobody was born just to die.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.100
You've grown up so strong...

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.060
You're like Kodai-<i>san</i>...

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:57.300
This happened to you because you fell
in love with my damn dad... Ayumi-<i>san</i>...

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:08.270
When I came to Dela Granto,
I learned real loneliness.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:17.280
I was able to politically depose of Ryuzoji
and stop him from taking over...

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:23.260
And then I became Divine Emperor.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:29.260
But the lonely nights never went away.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:33.790
I knew you'd come to me someday...

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:37.260
That was the only thing that kept me going...

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.990
I'm sorry it took so long...

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.790
Your hand is so warm...

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:50.630
Ayumi-<i>san</i>...

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.450
Hold me tighter...

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:58.820
Ayumi doesn't like the cold...

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:12.880
Warning: 200 seconds until the
dimensional synchronization system

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.510
completes synchronization.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.760
200 seconds until the 
limit horizon is breached.

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:19.390
That's not good.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.640
The limit horizon breach
and the synchronization

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:22.760
taking place in the same instant?

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.300
What does that mean?

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:29.900
If they occur simultaneously, that means
that just when you and I synchronize,

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:32.360
Dela Granto and Earth
will reach a point where they

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.010
can no longer avoid each other.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:35.780
Then...

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.250
Even if the ritual succeeds...

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:41.320
It's a 50-50 chance.

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.750
If only we had even an extra second...

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:47.160
Just a single second,
but still, a single second.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:51.520
Even a single femtosecond would be
enough to avoid the world's destruction.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.000
Not now...

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.770
Eriko-<i>sensei</i>? What's wrong?

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:01.730
The Dimensional Inspectors Bureau
has decided my mission is finished.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:05.590
I'm being forced to return 
to my own dimension.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.700
Arima, don't lose hope.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:11.330
Of course I won't.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.570
I'm glad I met you.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:17.530
And I hope we'll meet again
in another parallel world.

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:24.860
Priestess, farewell.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:26.950
Make sure you have no regrets.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:27.650
Yes.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.290
Yu-No, are you okay?

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.420
Yeah. I'm fine.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:41.960
I remember the days when you and me
and mom all slept in the same bed.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:45.050
We'll do it again someday.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:46.470
Yeah.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.890
Okay, here I go.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.280
Wait for me!

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:07.110
Even if you're sent beyond the
dimensional horizon, I'll come for you!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:14.000
Daddy! Daddy!

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:35.070
Grantia, are this rate, they'll all...

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.440
What's that?

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.650
What? The sky...

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:45.450
Unfortunately, the fate of dimensional
collision cannot be avoided.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:49.630
If only we could cause the collision in
a time and place where nobody lived...

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.910
The energy values are of an

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.910
entirely different order of
magnitude than any cycle before.

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:58.590
Using the maximum event shock,
it's not impossible, but...

00:12:58.710 --> 00:12:59.750
Then...

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.170
But if that's done,

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:04.500
the body of the priestess will exceed
the speed of the event elements...

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.090
And what happens then?

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:11.220
The event order of the priestess
begins to run backwards.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:14.280
Just like how tachyons that exceed
the speed of light go backwards in time...

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:18.010
What happens then, only God knows...

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.450
I'm fine with that.

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:24.270
Very well.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.940
This is an event spiral, 
repeating infinitely.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:07.360
Even now, another Dela Granto
wanders the dimensional rifts,

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:11.090
repeating its approach
and withdrawal from this Earth.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.790
Tell me, Grantia...

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:17.370
Will we ever be able to
cut these chains of fate?

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:37.570
I'm sorry.

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:41.480
I think it's over...

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:42.480
Kanna-<i>chan</i>...

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:48.880
Even after you said I'm not alone...
that you wanted to live with me...

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.950
I'll go get some psychite!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.990
Psychite!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.470
I'll get it from another dimension!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.070
I promise!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.110
So just wait for me!

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.000
Mother...

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:17.780
I'm back.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.270
This is...

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:31.450
"With Most Beloved"

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:26.440
Is something wrong?

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.240
I see...

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.010
So that's how it ended up...

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.160
It connected...

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:37.390
It all just connected!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.340
The route I followed was the right one!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.690
Right, Amanda?

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:58.180
I just said goodbye to you a moment ago,
but you seem very different.

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:01.360
Yeah, a lot's happened.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.650
Really, a lot.

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:10.760
As promised, this is the psychite.

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:15.000
It's crystallized, so it will never break.

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:17.450
Thank you!

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:24.080
I lived my whole life 
just trying to not die...

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:27.210
And you gave me such a wonderful time!

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.340
So did Yuki and Mio.

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.700
Yes. You're right.

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:37.670
From now on, an even more
wonderful time is waiting for you.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:41.230
Please, be happy.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:45.490
Are you going somewhere, Arima-<i>san</i>?

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:50.780
Somebody's been waiting
for me for thousands of years.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.460
I have to go see them.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:57.060
Goodbye.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.980
Thank you.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.460
"An Introduction to the Takanoamahara People"

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:17.220
"Geotechnics"

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.900
"Computers"

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.320
"Our Monthly Deal"

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:39.100
I'm transferring to an international school.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.630
I want to get away from 
Sakaimachi for a while.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.210
I see.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.210
Um, I...

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:56.620
I... I'm going to learn English!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:02.510
I know you like the boss!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.600
But... I won't give up!

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:12.230
I like that about you, Yuki-<i>kun</i>.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.970
I'm pretty sure it's this way.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.120
Yu-No!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.450
Are you okay?

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:06.410
Daddy... I missed you.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.080
Me too.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:11.430
I touched Grantia's mind.

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:14.990
But I couldn't change fate.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:19.470
Dela Granto fell here 8,000 years ago.

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:21.510
I see.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:22.340
Then...

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.860
It's still below Mt. Sankaku?

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:29.600
It's thanks to this that
I was able to come here.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:32.930
Yu-No?

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:37.220
The time has come for me to
give myself over to the event elements.

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:38.420
This is goodbye.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:43.410
Thank you, Daddy.

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:48.950
I won't let you be alone anymore.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.120
Before, you disappeared alone.

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:58.760
But this time I won't let you go alone!

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:02.180
I won't let you travel to
the end of this world alone!

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:06.120
There's nothing there.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.180
You'll be there.

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.090
And Sayless, too.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.230
Daddy!

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:52.790
Takuya.

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:55.290
I saw everything.

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:57.010
As did Keiko.

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:02.110
I'll be honest. I'm jealous of you.

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:07.620
You and Yu-No will now travel
the rift between events...

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:15.430
You'll have a window into the truth of history
that I always longed for as a historian.

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:21.940
As the observer of the Tree of Vrinda,

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:24.430
I will continue my search through history.

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:26.910
Now, it's time.

00:22:27.490 --> 00:22:29.560
Thank you for stopping in.

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:32.470
I'm glad we had this one last talk.

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.250
And I'll be dreaming we meet again...

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:43.340
It's pitch black.

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:45.390
Yeah, it is.

00:22:46.380 --> 00:22:47.470
It's just the two of us, huh?

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:51.370
Yeah. This may be hell.

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:53.470
That's not true.

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:57.640
We're an instant and eternity.

00:22:58.310 --> 00:23:00.770
We're traveling up the stream of events.

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:04.810
Hey, Daddy. Look.

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:10.700
It's sprouting...

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:12.160
It's so cute.

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:14.210
It's still a tiny child.

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:17.540
A tree that remembers
everything about this world.

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:21.980
Hey, want to give it a name?

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:23.500
Good idea.

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:27.820
I actually already thought of one.

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:30.410
Do you know what it is?

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:33.780
Yes. I do.

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:37.550
Yes, the name of this child is...
